--Description / Thinking process:
-- Goal: confirm whether *any* repository appears multiple times in the LANGUAGES table,
-- which would indicate that a repo can have several language rows (e.g., one per scan).
-- Steps:
--   1. GROUP BY "repo_name" to aggregate all rows belonging to each repository.
